<section id="faq" class="section-padding bg-white">
  <div class="container-custom max-w-4xl">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">Everything you need to know about our private AI solutions.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <details class="card group cursor-pointer">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-lg">Is my data truly private?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">Yes. Your AI runs entirely on your own infrastructure — no data is sent to cloud services, third-party APIs, or external servers. Everything stays within your office network.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="card group cursor-pointer">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-lg">Can it work without internet?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">Yes. Local AI models operate fully offline. Some features like web search or external API integrations require internet, but the core AI functions without it.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="card group cursor-pointer">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-lg">Can you build the hardware?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">Yes. We design, assemble, and configure custom AI workstations — or work with your existing hardware vendor in any European country.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="card group cursor-pointer">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-lg">Do you provide maintenance?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">Yes. All packages include remote maintenance — updates, model upgrades, monitoring, and optimization. Enterprise includes priority SLA.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="card group cursor-pointer">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-lg">Can existing office computers be upgraded?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">Yes. If your current hardware meets the requirements (GPU, RAM), we can upgrade it instead of replacing. We evalute on a case-by-case basis.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="card group cursor-pointer">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-lg">Which industries do you serve?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">We specialize in data-sensitive sectors: legal firms, healthcare clinics, accounting offices, engineering companies, manufacturing, real estate, and government/defense.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="card group cursor-pointer">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-lg">How long does deployment take?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">Typically 3 working days on-site: Day 1 — hardware setup + Linux, Day 2 — AI stack deployment, Day 3 — training + documentation + handover.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>